      "questionText": "設空間向量 $\\tilde{a} = (2, -1, 3)$、$\\tilde{b} = (1, 2, -1)$，求兩向量的夾角 $\\theta$。",
      "answerText": "($\\tilde{a} \\bullet \\tilde{b}$) = $2 \\times 1 + (-1) \\times 2 + 3 \\times (-1)$ = $2 - 2 - 3$ = $-3$，$|\\tilde{a}| = \\frac{\\text{sqrt}(2^2 + (-1)^2 + 3^2)}{1}$ = $\\text{sqrt}(4 + 1 + 9)$ = $\\text{sqrt}(14)$，$|\\tilde{b}| = \\frac{\\text{sqrt}(1^2 + 2^2 + (-1)^2)}{1}$ = $\\text{sqrt}(1 + 4 + 1)$ = $\\text{sqrt}(6)$，故 $\\text{cos} \\theta = \\frac{-3}{\\text{sqrt}(14) \\times \\text{sqrt}(6)}$ = $\\frac{-3}{\\text{sqrt}(84)}$，$\\theta = \\text{acos}\\bigg(\\frac{-3}{\\sqrt{84}}\\bigg)$。",
